/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
# export_sprites.py 用 git archive 解出来的参照精灵，只用于比对/导出，不入库
assets/target/
# 排查用的临时工程、原始数据和试听文件，不入库
.work/
# 曲子目录：用户自己的音乐不入库
assets/Songs/
# Mojang 版权方块贴图：只入「20 个内置乐器真的会画到的那几张」（合计约 4 KB），
# 其余 1000 多张是扒 jar 时的顺带产物，跟乐器无关，不入库，需要时现跑
# tools/fetch_block_textures.py。白名单不是手抄的：`fx::tiles` 里那条测试会拿
# INSTRUMENT_BLOCKS / COPPER_INS_BLOCKS 现算出该用哪张图，对不上就红。
# 来路记录那份 JSON 是我们自己写的文字，跟进来，别克隆的人才知道图是从哪个 jar 扒的。
assets/Blocks/*
!assets/Blocks/PROVENANCE.json
!assets/Blocks/bone_block_side.png
!assets/Blocks/clay.png
!assets/Blocks/cobblestone.png
!assets/Blocks/copper_block.png
!assets/Blocks/dirt.png
!assets/Blocks/emerald_block.png
!assets/Blocks/exposed_copper.png
!assets/Blocks/glass.png
!assets/Blocks/glowstone.png
!assets/Blocks/gold_block.png
!assets/Blocks/hay_block_side.png
!assets/Blocks/iron_block.png
!assets/Blocks/oak_planks.png
!assets/Blocks/oxidized_copper.png
!assets/Blocks/packed_ice.png
!assets/Blocks/pumpkin_side.png
!assets/Blocks/sand.png
!assets/Blocks/soul_sand.png
!assets/Blocks/weathered_copper.png
!assets/Blocks/white_wool.png
